# Normalise line endings so a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true does not
# diverge from freshly-rendered or regex-matched content. Generated command
# artefacts (docs/generated/**) are compared byte-for-byte against the renderer
# in tests, and workflow YAML is regex-matched on "\n" in
# package-installability.test.ts; both break on CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary fixtures must never be renormalised.
*.parquet binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.tgz binary
*.gz binary
*.zip binary
